      item-43 at level 3: formula: S
      item-44 at level 3: text: , and charm, 
      item-45 at level 3: formula: C
      item-46 at level 3: text: . This involves taking appropriate derivatives of the total pressure,
  item-47 at level 1: formula: \begin{equation}
    P=\frac{T}{ ... ,\hat{\mu}_C)
    \; ,

\end{equation}
